OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from this year's Proms
OL,8,     Fincluding Mahler's 6th Symphony
OL,9,     Ffrom the BBC Symphony Orchestra
OL,10,     Fplus recordings from the recent
OL,11,     F2026 Aldeburgh Festival.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,13,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,14,     Fearly years of Smith's marriage to
OL,15,     Fa lawyer, Frederick Meadows White.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FKatie welcomes Carolin Widmann to
OL,18,     FIn Tune. Phelim McDermott on
OL,19,     Fdirecting Tao of Glass.
