OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto is back with another hour
OL,7,     Fof the best in jazz, and we return
OL,8,     Fto Jazzahead in Bremen with a live
OL,9,     Fhighlight and words from Ghanaian
OL,10,     Ftrumpeter Peter Somuah.
OL,11,G0030 Through the Night
OL,12,     FThe Hungarian Radio Symphony
OL,13,     FOrchestra, Budapest plays Mahler's
OL,14,     Ffifth symphony. Agnes Langer plays
OL,15,     FMozart's fourth violin concerto in
OL,16,     Fa contrasting first half of the
OL,17,     Fconcert.
